module Projects
  documentation
    ```markdown
    Projects owns naming decisions.
    ```
  feature Naming
    documentation
      ```markdown
      Renaming retains the project identity.
      ```
    slice StateChange Rename
      documentation
        ```markdown
        A rename changes the name, not the event source.
        ```
      command Rename
        documentation
          ```markdown
          The caller supplies the existing project identifier.
          ```
        projectId Uuid identifier
        name String
        produces event Renamed
          description "The project acquired another name"
          documentation
            ```markdown
            The project keeps its event source identity.
            ```
          tag audit
          name String = name
